Package: scx-beerland
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: locality-oriented sched_ext scheduler
 Beerland prioritizes CPU locality and scales queue placement and load
 balancing across cache domains.
 .
 This package provides the scx_beerland command.

Package: scx-bpfland
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: per-CPU eligible deadline sched_ext scheduler
 BPFLand uses per-CPU queues, virtual-time borrowing and requests sized by
 observed CPU bursts.
 .
 This package provides the scx_bpfland command.

Package: scx-cake
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: gaming-oriented sched_ext scheduler
 CAKE uses per-CPU dispatch and task placement tuned for interactive gaming
 workloads.
 .
 This package provides the scx_cake command.

Package: scx-chaos
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental race-amplifying sched_ext scheduler
 Chaos perturbs task execution to increase the likelihood of exposing
 timing-dependent bugs.
 .
 This package provides the scx_chaos command.

