Description: CPU-locality sched_ext scheduler
 Cosmos preserves CPU locality and balances load across cache domains.
 .
 This package provides the scx_cosmos command.

Package: scx-eevdf
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: earliest eligible virtual deadline sched_ext scheduler
 This BPF scheduler implements earliest eligible virtual deadline first
 scheduling in the sched_ext class.
 .
 This package provides the scx_eevdf command.

