Package: scx-flow
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental topology-aware sched_ext scheduler
 Flow uses cache topology and per-task state to guide CPU placement and
 ordering.
 .
 This package provides the scx_flow command.

Package: scx-forge
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental sched_ext scheduler template
 Forge provides a runnable scheduler with tunable policy parameters for use
 as a template for scheduler generation.
 .
 This package provides the scx_forge command.

Package: scx-lavd
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: latency-aware virtual deadline sched_ext scheduler
 LAVD uses latency criticality to guide CPU selection and virtual-deadline
 scheduling for interactive tasks.
 .
 This package provides the scx_lavd command.

Package: scx-layered
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: configurable layered sched_ext scheduler
 Layered classifies tasks into layers and applies configurable CPU
 allocation and scheduling rules to each layer.
 .
 This package provides the scx_layered command.

Package: scx-mavd
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental arena-based sched_ext scheduler
 MAVD is an arena-based variant of LAVD that uses context IDs for per-task
 state.
 .
 This package provides the scx_mavd command.

Package: scx-mitosis
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: dynamic CPU affinity sched_ext scheduler
 Mitosis adjusts CPU affinity for groups of tasks as their load changes. A
 cgroup configuration defines the groups.
 .
 This package provides the scx_mitosis command.

Package: scx-mlfq
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental feedback queue sched_ext scheduler
 MLFQ uses feedback from task execution to adapt queue placement and
 ordering across multiple levels.
 .
 This package provides the scx_mlfq command.

Package: scx-nitosis
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental hierarchical sched_ext scheduler
 Nitosis extends Mitosis with arena-based state and cgroup sub-scheduling.
 It requires the kernel's sub_cid_sched_updated struct_ops callback.
 .
 This package provides the scx_nitosis command.

Package: scx-p2dq
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: pick-two load-balancing sched_ext scheduler
 P2DQ selects between sampled CPUs or cache domains to balance load and
 preserve locality.
 .
 This package provides the scx_p2dq command.

Package: scx-panda
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental CoDel-based sched_ext scheduler
 Panda uses per-CPU CoDel queues, cache-distance costs and observed task run
 durations.
 .
 This package provides the scx_panda command.

Package: scx-pandemonium
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: adaptive CoDel-based sched_ext scheduler
 Pandemonium uses CoDel queue sojourn time and cache-distance costs to guide
 adaptive task placement.
 .
 This package provides the scx_pandemonium command.

Package: scx-rburst
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental Rust BPF burst-aware sched_ext scheduler
 RBurst uses per-CPU queues and eligible virtual deadlines with requests
 sized by observed CPU bursts.
 .
 This package provides the scx_rburst command.

Package: scx-reevdf
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental Rust BPF eligible deadline sched_ext scheduler
 REEVDF implements earliest eligible virtual deadline first scheduling in
 Rust BPF.
 .
 This package provides the scx_reevdf command.

Package: scx-rlocal
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental Rust BPF per-CPU sched_ext scheduler
 RLocal uses per-CPU queues with locality-aware task placement.
 .
 This package provides the scx_rlocal command.

Package: scx-rusty
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: multi-domain hybrid sched_ext scheduler
 Rusty schedules tasks in BPF and balances load between CPU domains from
 user space.
 .
 This package provides the scx_rusty command.

Package: scx-rvtime
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental Rust BPF virtual-time sched_ext scheduler
 RVTime uses weighted virtual-time ordering with per-CPU queues.
 .
 This package provides the scx_rvtime command.

Package: scx-tickless
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${cargo:Built-Using}
Static-Built-Using: ${cargo:Static-Built-Using}
Description: experimental tickless sched_ext scheduler
 Tickless targets server workloads that benefit from reduced scheduler tick
 activity and CPU isolation.
 .
 This package provides the scx_tickless command.

Package: scx-full
Section: metapackages
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 scx-beerland (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-bpfland (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-cake (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-chaos (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-cosmos (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-eevdf (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-flash (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-flow (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-forge (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-lavd (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-layered (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-mavd (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-mitosis (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-mlfq (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-nitosis (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-p2dq (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-panda (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-pandemonium (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-rburst (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-reevdf (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-rlocal (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-rusty (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-rvtime (>= ${source:Version}),
 scx-tickless (>= ${source:Version})
Description: full set of sched_ext schedulers from scx
 This metapackage installs all schedulers built by the scx source package
 for this architecture. Each package provides a command that an
 administrator can run to select a scheduler.
